  "citation": "Santos F; Breen A; Coffman K (2024): Aqueous Organic Matter from Kougarok Fire Complex, Alaska, 2023. Next-Generation Ecosystem Experiments (NGEE) Arctic. Dataset. doi:10.15485/2455027",
  "dataset": {
